  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific Contract 000045 - BEACON DI 7920-Lot 1 
Benchmarking Support to accelerate the transformation of INTPA to deliver on its strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Since the appointment to the Director General, INTPA has carried out various actions to encourage staff engagement and support knowledge development, co-creation and ultimately shift INTPA&#xbf;s internal culture, ways of working and procedures. The assignment will focus in to providing benchmark inputs and leverage them to sketch a transformation approach, a change strategy and first-year-plan for the transformation, with a focus on quick wins.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
